---
layout: page
includeMeLinks: true
styles: |
  .home-update-content {
    max-height: 20em;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .home-section-intro {
    margin-top: 2em;
  }
---
<p>This is the personal website of Jan Marthedal Rasmussen.</p>

{% set latestUpdate = collections.updates[0] -%}
{% set latestPosts = collections.posts | reverse | head(5) -%}

<p class="home-section-intro">
  The latest update to my <a href="/feed/">feed</a> is the following:
</p>
<ul class="update-list">
  <li>
    <div class="update-content home-update-content">
      {{ latestUpdate.content | safe }}
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>

<p class="home-section-intro">
  My five latest <a href="/posts/">posts</a> are:
</p>
<ul class="post-list">
  {%- for post in latestPosts %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.title }}</a> <small>{{ post.date | readableDate }}</small>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
